  "thag1.110:0.4": "Thag 1:110 Usabha ",
  "thag1.110:1.1": "Trees on the hilltops\nare flourishing, ",
  "thag1.110:1.2": "watered by a new high-rising cloud, ",
  "thag1.110:1.3": "giving birth to even more goodness\nfor Usabha— ",
  "thag1.110:1.4": "desiring seclusion,\nconscious of\n“wilderness.” ",
